<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>OficJus Driver — Download</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Merriweather:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <style>
    .welcome-wrapper { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
    .welcome-box { width: 100%; max-width: 32rem; background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.12); border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); text-align: center; }
    .welcome-box h1 { font-family: 'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .welcome-box .emoji { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .welcome-box p { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .welcome-box .btn-download { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 1rem 2rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: #22c55e; color: #fff; font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s; }
    .welcome-box .btn-download:hover { background: #16a34a; }
    .welcome-box .steps { text-align: left; background: rgba(10,22,40,0.5); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .welcome-box .steps ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    .welcome-box .steps li { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.8; }
    .welcome-box .steps li strong { color: #e2e8f0; }
    .welcome-box .back-link { display: block; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: #64748b; }
    .welcome-box .back-link a { color: #3b82f6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="welcome-wrapper">
    <div class="welcome-box">
      <div class="emoji">🎉</div>
      <h1>Conta confirmada!</h1>
      <p>Sua conta no <strong>OficJus Driver</strong> está ativa. Agora é só baixar o aplicativo e começar a usar.</p>

      <a href="app-debug.apk" class="btn-download" download>📲 Baixar APK (24 MB)</a>

      <div class="steps">
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Baixe o APK</strong> clicando no botão acima</li>
          <li><strong>Abra o arquivo</strong> no seu celular Android</li>
          <li><strong>Permita a instalação</strong> de fontes desconhecidas (se necessário)</li>
          <li><strong>Pronto!</strong> O ícone do OficJus Drive aparecerá na tela inicial</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:#64748b;">Precisa de ajuda? <a href="mailto:contato@oficjus.com.br" style="color:#3b82f6;">contato@oficjus.com.br</a></p>

      <div class="back-link"><a href="index.html">← Voltar para o site</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    // Botao sair
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
      const btnSair = document.createElement('a');
      btnSair.href = '#';
      btnSair.textContent = 'Sair';
      btnSair.style.cssText = 'display:inline-block;margin-top:0.5rem;padding:0.5rem 2rem;border-radius:0.75rem;border:1px solid rgba(71,85,105,0.3);color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.875rem;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s;';
      btnSair.onmouseover = function() { this.style.borderColor = '#64748b'; this.style.color = '#e2e8f0'; };
      btnSair.onmouseout = function() { this.style.borderColor = 'rgba(71,85,105,0.3)'; this.style.color = '#94a3b8'; };
      btnSair.onclick = function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        window.close();
      };
      document.querySelector('.welcome-box').appendChild(btnSair);
    });
  </script>
</html>